# Cache page chips

This page's stack chips (`.sbadge`) use the OKLCH tokens already in `:root`. Do not set `--pill-c` to a hex color.

- One word inside each chip. Put the rest of the label in the sentence under the row.
- Claude uses `var(--margin)`. Gemini uses `var(--accent)`. The cache read uses `var(--sage)`. The cost pairing uses `var(--amber)`.
- The chip border uses `var(--line)`. Define `--line` on this page.
- The row wraps (`flex-wrap: wrap`). Do not set `white-space: nowrap` on `.sbadge`.
- At `760px`, `body` uses `background-attachment: scroll`.
- Do not edit the other guides in the same change. They still have hex chips. One page per pull request.
- Do not reopen pull requests 6 or 9. Do not edit the health page, the cost page, or pull request 15 in this change.
